      "content": "idk im not sure it's even an allergy, its just like a little tingle. and honestly i really dont have time for an ER visit or anything like that if it's just a tiny thing. i usually take like 300mg of caffeine to focus anyway so i feel like it'll just help me stay alert. like, if i just take the supplement, won't that actually help me stay on top of how i'm feeling?",
